      48.81,
      549.13,
      538.89,
      584.2
    ],
    "text": "The Insurance Board of Sri Lanka Rules of 2005 published in Gazette Extraordinary No. 1412/30 datedSeptember 29, 2005, as last amended by Gazette Extraordinary No. 1642/16 dated February 25, 2010 are hereby furtheramended as follows :-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
