    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      84.81,
      597.13,
      385.42,
      608.2
    ],
    "text": "1. by the repeal of rule 8 and the substitution therefore of the following -",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      93.81,
      621.13,
      443.51,
      632.2
    ],
    "text": "\u201c8. (1) A person to be appointed as the principal officer by an insurer shall possess -",
